This product includes software developed by Stéphane Sibué
for embedded scripting on .NET nanoFramework microcontrollers.

MOGWAI NANO is a companion project to MOGWAI, a stack-based RPN
scripting engine for .NET (https://github.com/Sydney680928/mogwai).

